  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason (variance of the lotteries) matches the individual's consideration of the potential high loss and gain of Lottery B, implying an understanding of risk. The individual's justification for choosing Lottery A because of the high potential loss of Lottery B aligns with preferring the lottery with the smaller variance. Therefore, it appears the decision reason was used.",
